        <briefdescription>
<para>κ-gate: estimate whether decomposition is worthwhile. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns <computeroutput>true</computeroutput> when the pilot compressibility estimate κ ≥ <computeroutput>min_kappa</computeroutput>. Implementations are permitted to use a randomised approximation.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>embedding</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The dense vector to probe. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>min_kappa</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Minimum compression ratio to justify decomposition. Default: 1.3 (boundary from TT boundary analysis). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
